────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
WHY AGPL-3.0
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
This project computes planetary positions with the Swiss Ephemeris
(https://www.astro.com/swisseph/), via the `swisseph-wasm` package. The Swiss
Ephemeris is dual-licensed:

  1. GNU Affero General Public License v3 (AGPL-3.0), OR
  2. A paid Swiss Ephemeris Professional license from Astrodienst AG.

Because this project distributes and links the Swiss Ephemeris under option (1),
the combined work is licensed under the AGPL-3.0.

If you wish to distribute a CLOSED-SOURCE or PROPRIETARY derivative of this
application, the AGPL grant is not sufficient: you must obtain a commercial
Swiss Ephemeris license from Astrodienst AG (swisseph@astro.com) and separate
your code from the AGPL portions accordingly.

Full AGPL-3.0 text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.txt
